# Preserve production URLs (SEO critical)

At any cost, do **not** change or break URLs that already rank or work on the live site.

## Locked public paths

- Articles: `/news/{newsurl}` — use the exact `news.newsurl` value from MySQL. Never invent new slug schemes.
- Categories: `/category/{cat_url}` — use exact `categories.cat_url` from DB.
- Images / media: keep `/images/news/...`, `/team/...`, `/ads/...`, `/images/logo/...`.
- Admin: one login (`/login`) and dashboard (`/admin`). No extra login entry points.

## Local browser rule

- Open **only** `http://localhost:3000` (public + admin). Apache `:8080` is the backend engine — never send users to `:8080` for browsing.
- Old PHP public skins must redirect to Next.js with the **same path**.

## Production

- Same path → same content. Do not rename `newsurl` or image files for “clean URLs.”
